Package: alx-installer-config
Version: 0.1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Algothix OS Maintainers <maintainers@algothix.com>
Installed-Size: 21
Depends: calamares, calamares-settings-debian, alx-branding
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: foreign
Homepage: https://algothix.com
Description: Calamares installer configuration and AES-NI LUKS gate for ALX Lite
 Configures Calamares for guided ext4-only installation with noatime/commit=60
 mount options, dynamically disables LUKS encryption on CPUs without AES-NI
 hardware acceleration, enables first-boot alx-tune on the installed system,
 and removes live-only installer packages after installation.
